WEBVTT

00:35:29.913 --> 00:35:35.829
And you have this great chapter about
just how far fans of these teams are

00:35:35.829 --> 00:35:39.288
willing to go to torture
the opposing team.

00:35:39.288 --> 00:35:43.246
And what you tried, what didn't work
and what finally seemed to break

00:35:43.246 --> 00:35:47.496
the ice of having them sort of find
the humanity in each other.

00:35:48.079 --> 00:35:55.538
So my question to you is, what was what
surprised you in your attempts to build

00:35:55.538 --> 00:36:01.746
those bridges between those two fan bases
? And what were your findings? In summary
,